              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zakariya 3:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku mwenga Mikaeli, malaika mkpwulu, wakala anaheha na Shetani kuhusu ni ani ndiyehala mwiri wa Musa. Dzagbwe Mikaeli ni mkpwulu wa malaika osi, kayalaphiza wala kuhukumu Shetani, ela waamba, “Mlungu mwenye andakudemurira!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela atu hinya nkulaphiza chochosi asichochimanya. Nao ni dza nyama a weruni ambao nkuhenda mambo asigoelewa; nao andaangamizwa kpwa kuhenda hivyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
